            <div type="translation" xml:lang="en" resp="#AA">
                <p>
                    Sacred to Victoria, for the safety of Imperator [[[Marcus Iulius Philippius F]]]elix Augustus, pontifex maximus, with tribunician power for the 3rd time, consul and father of the fatherland
                    and of [[[Marcus Iulius Phili]]]ppus the most noble Caesar, [[[prince]], pius, youth, [[[and Marcia Otacilia]] Se[[[vera Augusta]]] mother of the camps and their majesty.
                    Aurel[i]us Munatianus, evocatus from the 6th cohort of [[[pious]]] praetorians, [[[protector of Philippus]]] <!-- CHECK AND FINISH -->
                </p>
